    <string name="restore_dialog_body">Lighting, sleep, key colors and key mapping (except protected keys) return to “%1$s”. The current state is backed up first.</string>
    <string name="safety_title">Safety</string>
    <string name="safety_1">No firmware update, reset or erase command exists in this app.</string>
    <string name="safety_2">Only the original F75 model identity is configured; anything else is refused.</string>
    <string name="safety_3">Before writing, the keyboard is read again; if it changed, nothing is written.</string>
    <string name="safety_4">Every write is backed up first and verified byte-for-byte afterwards.</string>
    <string name="safety_5">F1–F12 and Fn can never be remapped and no key can be disabled. Factory reset: usually hold Fn + Esc for 3–5 s (check your manual).</string>
